<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2025-06 on</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2025-06/</link><description>Recent content in 2025-06 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 21 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2025-06/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>비오는날의 카페 페이스포포</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/place/daily16/</link><pubDate>Sat, 21 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/place/daily16/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="비오는날의-카페-페이스포포"&gt;&#10; 비오는날의 카페 페이스포포&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%b9%84%ec%98%a4%eb%8a%94%eb%82%a0%ec%9d%98-%ec%b9%b4%ed%8e%98-%ed%8e%98%ec%9d%b4%ec%8a%a4%ed%8f%ac%ed%8f%ac"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2025-06-21&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/789c9b39-de16-447a-b718-46368224a0ae" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;팍팍한 일상이지만 오랜만에 브런치먹으러 왔다..!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/371a05d3-dd7d-4b05-908c-22ab97f06ccd" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f078e43-d54c-4004-9fad-cc0818ab2b8d" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;오늘 시킨 메뉴는 루꼴라 잠봉뵈르 / 루꼴라 쉬림프 타르틴 / 페스츄리소세지 푀이테 / 플레인 사워도우!!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;여기는 모든메뉴가 맛이 중~상이어서 역시 맛있었다 ㅎㅎ 그래두 젤 마싯었던건 루꼴라 잠봉뵈르(이유: 원래 조아하는 스타일이라서..)였구 엄마아빠는 페스츄리소세지 마싯다고했는데 난그냥 무난했음&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;루꼴라 쉬림프 타르틴은 저번에도 시켰던건데 이메뉴는 실패가 없다. ㅎㅎ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abb53ba3-27b3-4740-bb40-485826ceeb38" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87f0218b-b912-423a-97c0-1d5530e09277" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/178ae3d8-5669-4d25-b0be-9fe3064078ed" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;비오니깐 뭔가 더 이쁜것같은 내부&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e394953-2c5b-4e7a-a6e7-d7e7f16286f3" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>여름 경주</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/travel/daily15/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/travel/daily15/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="여름-경주"&gt;&#10; 여름 경주&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%97%ac%eb%a6%84-%ea%b2%bd%ec%a3%bc"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2025-06-08&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5071568-8852-4d99-b07f-585fda3992c8" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/113b32aa-027a-4b17-b024-865d211818d4" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dfa99727-330e-4ad4-bd03-aa1316194342" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/74b64da7-20d8-495f-a46d-b999b71aac48" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4093d0f8-e4ee-4168-920b-23ea2664324a" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1179" height="1789" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9594c234-76fd-4b84-bd12-0b6a5abcf225" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fcb6098c-a3e7-4f0e-be04-e9a2460b3636" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20118ad2-e151-4ddb-980f-7064d99f60d9" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aef92c58-1abe-45af-bb9f-6f85a65e3173" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/255ddd23-7ac1-47d9-bb4c-903b3120242b" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1920" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd7667e8-7887-4e95-9462-0e8588895caf" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a952e658-1b17-4d68-9cce-e175117f656c" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16790211-841d-46de-8610-7f6d9443e5d2" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;주말이순삭됐지만 재밌었다 ㅎㅎ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b134d72e-ca0f-436c-914f-7d684cef0e6e" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;행운/대박/합격 이런것만 보면 저항없이 사는 사람 ㅠ&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>ADsP 45회</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/previous/2024/career1/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/previous/2024/career1/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="adsp-45회"&gt;&#10; ADsP 45회&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#adsp-45%ed%9a%8c"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2025-06-05&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e55320a8-12f1-4883-8214-1794f55f830f" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;ㅎㅎ 붙었다!!&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>불행 속 우아함</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/book/book39/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/book/book39/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="불행-속-우아함"&gt;&#10; 불행 속 우아함&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%b6%88%ed%96%89-%ec%86%8d-%ec%9a%b0%ec%95%84%ed%95%a8"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2025-06-02&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#1&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;해소되지 않은 기분은 성격이 된다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;작은 짜증으로 시작된 기분은 일상에 대한 분노로 이어지고 속속들이 헤쳐 모여 결국 더러운 성격으로 완성된다. 어떤 성격으로 살고 싶은지는 빼곡히 적은 새해 다짐이 아니라 일상을 어떻게 다루는지에 달려 있었다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;사람의 진짜 우아함은 무너졌을 때 드러난다고 한다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;윗사람에게 깨진 날 후배를 대하는 태도나 안 좋은 일이 넘친 날 웃응며 인사할 줄 아는 여유에서 우린 그 사람의 깊이를 느낄 수 있다. 그러니까 우아함이란 다시 말해 이렇게 정의할 수 있을 것이다. 마음이 두 조각 난 날에도 평소처럼 인사하고 웃고 공들여 사과할 수 있는 태도.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>